#! Hover where nothing is typed: inside a header comment, past the end of a
#! line, and past the end of the document. All three must answer `null`
#! promptly. A server that errors here makes an editor show an error popup
#! every time the mouse crosses whitespace.
name      requests/hover-nothing-there
profile   minimal

initialize
open      errors.lu
wait      diagnostics errors.lu
req       hover errors.lu 3:10
req       hover errors.lu 12:400
req       hover errors.lu 9000:0
shutdown
